    "CargoWorkspacePackage idempotency: the three-way version check is NOT applied to the VersionWriteTarget::CargoWorkspacePackage arm in this cycle. write_version on WorkspaceCargoResolver is assumed idempotent (writing the same version twice produces the same result and no error). If that assumption is wrong it is a defect deferred to a later cycle. No test covers this arm.",
    "Lockfile refresh logic, rewrite loops, changelog writes, pre_state_update, and delete_pre_json handling.",
    "Persisting VersionPlan to disk."
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC-1",
      "description": "When a VersionWriteTarget::Manifest(p) has current on-disk version == bump.to, write_version is NOT called and apply_version_plan returns Ok. The path p is still pushed to modified_paths and appears in ApplyOutcome::staged.",
      "is_error_case": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-2",
      "description": "When a VersionWriteTarget::Manifest(p) has current on-disk version == bump.from, write_version is called once with bump.to, path p is pushed to modified_paths, p appears in ApplyOutcome::staged, and apply_version_plan returns Ok. After apply the on-disk version at p equals bump.to.",
      "is_error_case": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-3",
      "description": "When a VersionWriteTarget::Manifest(p) has current on-disk version that is neither bump.from nor bump.to, apply_version_plan returns Err(GraphError::UnexpectedManifestVersion { path: p, expected_from: bump.from, expected_to: bump.to, found: <actual> }). The manifest is not modified. No path is pushed to modified_paths for this bump.",
      "is_error_case": true
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-4",
      "description": "When a VersionWriteTarget::Manifest(p) does not exist on disk, apply_version_plan returns the Err produced by ManifestFormat::from_path or callisto_manifests::open via the ? operator, relying on the existing From impls on GraphError. No new error variant or map_err wrapping is introduced. The manifest is not created and no path for this bump is pushed to modified_paths.",
      "is_error_case": true
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-5",
      "description": "When a VersionWriteTarget::Manifest(p) exists on disk but its version field cannot be parsed as a valid semver string, apply_version_plan returns the Err produced by handle.version() via the ? operator, relying on the existing From impl for ManifestError on GraphError. No new error variant is introduced. The manifest is not modified and no path is pushed to modified_paths.",
      "is_error_case": true
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-6",
      "description": "Paths in plan.consumed_changesets are pushed to modified_paths unconditionally, regardless of whether the corresponding file exists on disk. When the changeset file is present, it is removed from disk. When it is absent, no Io error is returned. In both cases the path appears in ApplyOutcome::staged.",
      "is_error_case": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-7",
      "description": "The test apply_is_idempotent_when_manifest_already_at_target_version passes. Test setup: bump.from=1.0.0, bump.to=1.1.0; manifest on disk is at 1.1.0 (== bump.to); changeset file exists on disk. After apply_version_plan: (1) on-disk manifest remains at 1.1.0, (2) changeset file is removed from disk, (3) both the Cargo.toml path and the changeset path appear in ApplyOutcome::staged.",
      "is_error_case": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-8",
      "description": "The test apply_returns_error_when_manifest_has_unexpected_version passes. Test setup: bump.from=1.0.0, bump.to=1.1.0; manifest on disk is at 2.0.0 (neither from nor to). apply_version_plan returns Err(GraphError::UnexpectedManifestVersion) and the manifest is unchanged.",
      "is_error_case": true
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-9",
      "description": "The test apply_stages_changeset_path_even_when_file_already_deleted passes. Test setup: bump.from=1.0.0, bump.to=1.1.0; manifest on disk is at 1.1.0 (== bump.to); changeset file does NOT exist on disk. After apply_version_plan: the changeset path appears in ApplyOutcome::staged and no error is returned.",
      "is_error_case": false
    }
  ],
  "api_surface": {
    "function": "apply_version_plan",
    "file": "crates/callisto-graph/src/apply.rs",
    "changes": [
      "In the VersionWriteTarget::Manifest arm of the write loop: replace the unconditional handle.write_version(&bump.to, permit) call with a three-way check. Read the current version; if == bump.to skip write; if == bump.from write; else return Err(GraphError::UnexpectedManifestVersion). Push p to modified_paths in all non-error cases (skip and write both stage the path).",
      "In the consumed_changesets loop: move modified_paths.push(cs_path.clone()) outside the if full.exists() block so it executes unconditionally. Keep the if full.exists() guard around fs::remove_file only."
    ]
  }
}

